格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One-click restart of the DSH service from Settings → General. A dsh-plugin for DeepSeek Harness; the restart row stays pinned at the bottom of the general settings page. 在设置 → 通用设置中一键重启 DSH 服务。DeepSeek Harness 的 dsh-plugin，重启行固定显示在通用设置页面最底部。","id":"gh:1338164268","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-setting-restart","slug":"893413974-bit/dsh-setting-restart","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","restart"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One-click restart of the DSH service from Settings → General. A dsh-plugin for DeepSeek Harness; the"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" restart row stays pinned at the bottom of the general settings page. 在设置 → 通用设置中一键重启 DSH 服务。DeepSee"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"k Harness 的 dsh-plugin，重启行固定显示在通用设置页面最底部。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-setting-restart"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"One-click restart of the DSH service, from **Settings → General**. The \"一键重启\" row is pinned at the v"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ery bottom of the General settings page — no matter how many rows are added above it later, it alway"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"s stays the last one. After the restart the page reconnects automatically and the row confirms it wi"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"th a green \"Connected\" state, so you always know the service is back."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- A **one-click restart** row at the bottom of **Settings → General** (below \"繁忙时 Enter 键行为\" / whate"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ver comes last).\n- The row is pinned with the maximum slot `order`, so it always renders at the bott"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"om of the page.\n- Restart is a real process restart: the host spawns a detached helper, exits, and t"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"he helper re-spawns the exact same `dsh` command (same executable, arguments, cwd and environment). "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"The browser tab reconnects automatically once the new instance binds the same port.\n- Bilingual UI c"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"opy (简体中文 / English), following the DSH client conventions.\n- Fully typed host invocation through th"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"e DSH Typert RPC registry (`settingRestart/restart`)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `dsh` ≥ 0.1.0-rc.6 (the `web` profile).\n- Node.js ≥ 20."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. Install the package into the `web` profile (this runs `pnpm add` inside the profile directory):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"2. Mount it as a loader entry by appending an `insert` patch to the profile's user patch layer — `$D"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"SH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` (`$DSH_HOME` defaults to `~/.dsh`):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"3. Start (or restart) the service:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"4. Open **Settings → General** — the \"一键重启\" row is at the very bottom. Click **重启** to restart the s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ervice; the page reconnects automatically."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> The same patch can be added to the home-level `$DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml` to enable the plugin fo"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" can be added to the home-level `$DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml` to enable the plugin for every profile."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The loader entry accepts an optional `config` block:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- `client.js` — the browser bundle (`dsh.client` / `exports[\"./client\"]`) that registers the setting"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"s row.\n- `typert.host.js` — the TYPERT host manifest (`exports[\"./typert\"]`) declaring the strict `s"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ettingRestart/restart` invocation.\n- `index.js` — the host plugin (`SettingRestartService`) that per"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"forms the restart.\n- `relaunch.js` — the detached helper that re-spawns the command after the old pr"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"start.\n- `relaunch.js` — the detached helper that re-spawns the command after the old process exits."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Publishing"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This package is published to npm and hosted on GitHub under the `dsh-plugin` topic:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
